<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.18.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.18.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.18.0 (2026-11-24): Chapter 11 release story done. Deck 4.1.0 and page 9.22.0 pass every automatic check and carry a recorded verdict from each of three roles on four conditions (agent-made, not independent)."""@en .

ex:TK11_Release_11_Build backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Review record 08-tooling/ch11-deck/logs_v4_1_0/REVIEW_RECORD_ch11_v1_1_0.md: 12 verdicts (four conditions times three roles), 11 met and 1 partly met (slide 34 is dense at 9 pt). Labelled agent-made and not independent. The review changed the deck before the verdicts: notes and result balloons written again for the one-box code, two missing imports added, three titles matched to their code, one wrong result visual repaired." .
ex:TK11_Release_11_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Re-run from the files on deck 4.1.0, manifest 1.4.0, source 1.2.0, page 9.22.0. Logs: 08-tooling/ch11-deck/logs_v4_1_0 (code check C1 C2 C4 C5, deck standard 1.2.0 13 of 13, overlap, reader notes, story prose, fit, layout, notes all clean) and 08-tooling/ch11-page/logs_v9_22_0 (code check C1 to C5 0 findings including the page; page test 9.39.0 exit 0, 416 features passed, 0 failed, with all 19 chapter-code examples opened and run in the browser)." .
ex:ST11_Release_11 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Criterion met: logs saved and a verdict from each role on each reviewed condition. Chapter 11 is released as deck 4.1.0 and page 9.22.0; deck 4.0.0, page 9.21.0 and page 9.20.0 stay as superseded files." .
ex:Obs1_Obj11_ReviewVerdicts a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj11_ReviewVerdicts ; backlog:observedValue 12 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-24T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "Chapter 11 only: 12 of 24 verdicts recorded (chapter 10 still to do)."@en .
